d water so he can  finally take a bath after a long time  and as he slowly takes his suit off eli  discovers that it is true that he can  breathe normally in there and therefore  he is able to hug his parents after  years of not having been able to in the  evening the parents talk about how happy  their son was after taking off the suit  the woman is very hopeful that her son  will be healed saying that they should  have faith and the man replies that he  has always had faith but he says it as a  complaint at night eli sees a bug  outside his window and suddenly he sees  the condensation of someone's breath on  the glass as well he gets scared and  asks his parents if he can sleep with  them in the morning he gives everyone  details of what he saw although he says  he is not sure if he was asleep or awake  so the doctor only takes this as a small  hallucination we see that for his  treatment sessions his parents cannot be  present to support him his mother tells  him to make another wish and he says  that he wants to be brave later we see  that they take him to a room where they  weigh him and take a picture of him then  they immobilize him on a table and the  doctor explains that she is going to put  a special virus inside his marrow to  restore his immune system we see that  the process is very painful and while he  is resisting eli sees a reflection of a  ghost child and falls asleep when he  comes too eli feels his whole body is on  fire and the doctors are only watching  him however he suddenly wakes up again  safe in his bedroom we see a girl  throwing rocks at his window to get his  attention so eli comes downstairs to  talk to her through a glass wall the  girl tells him that she knows that he is  sick since all the children that are in  there are she also tells him that she  too likes magic tricks and performs one  in which she lights a fire out of  nowhere using a piece of wood eli asks  how she did it but she replies that  revealing that secret would ruin the  magic and that there are things everyone  must discover on their own the boy wants  to invite her inside the house but the  girl says that she would never dare  enter and also that the owner of the  place hates her she warns him that the  house is dangerous also telling him not  to talk to anyone about what they talked  about on his way to his room eli runs  into a ghost girl in the hallway which  scares him away but then his father  appears and tells him that he must come  back to his room that evening the family  dines together and says a prayer before  eating eli gets angry because they don't  believe he saw another girl but his  mother convinces him that it was just  another hallucination that night eli  sees another ghost in his room then  using his breath on the window eli  writes his name but the ghost erases the  e from the left and takes it to the  right creating the word lie soon after  the ghost girl shows up again and tries  to attack him but his parents arrive to  help him to recover from what they think  is another hallucination the doctor  insists that it's just a side effect and  warns him that as the treatment  progresses these effects will worsen  which worries the parents during the  second session of the treatment we see  that they immobilize eli again and that  they have to open up his head to be able  to insert the cure there as well  meanwhile the mother is praying when the  father mocks her and says it will not  help at all the doctor comes out and  tells her that everything is working  perfectly that night eli says that the  doctor is lying in that he feels worse  however when his father tells him that  whether he wants to go away and be sick  forever or stay to get well the boy  decides to stay at bedtime eli hears  strange noises coming from his bathroom  his nose bleeds and the power goes out  then a ghost appears and although he  tries to convince himself it is not real  the ghost locks him in his room scares  him and even throws a wardrobe with him  inside and when he comes out he sees  that the word lie is carved on the  wardrobe the adult scold him even though  he insists it was not his fault  later when he speaks to his friend again  she tells him that the boy who lived  there before him also saw ghost although  the doctor had told him that none of his  patients ever had the girl also tells  him that he should not trust the doctor  or his parents saying that she did not  see the previous boy after his third  session of treatment eli gets scared at  this and says that he must get out of  there although he doesn't know how since  he could not survive outside without his  parents  then he hears some noises and some ghost  children begin to drag him through the  house leading him to the front door eli  gets trapped in the decontamination  chamber and then the ghost open the  front door that leads to outside for him  but the doctor arrives in time to save  him from his allergies then the boy gets  angry with everyone saying that the  doctor is a liar and that his parents  should believe him he gets so angry that  he breaks a glass nearby and then passes  out when he wakes up eli is in his room  while the doctor says that they must  give him some sort of medicine before  carrying out the third phase of  treatment his mother offers to give him  the medicine and the boy tells her that  he is not crazy although his father  looks at him as if he was the mother  tells him that she believes that he saw  things but she believes that what he saw  was not real the child accepts this  explanation and also accepts a pill that  his mother gives him as they hug eli  looks at the word lie from a side angle  and realizes that it forms the numbers  three one seven meanwhile the doctor  burns the boy's special suit while  everyone is waiting for the third phase  of treatment one afternoon eli talks to  the girl again telling her that he  thinks the three ghosts want to help him  out and that they gave him the code to  the secret door the boy is also  suspicious of her so he asks her if she  is a ghost but the girl jokes and says  that she is real and that he has become  paranoid that night eli uses a password  to enter a secret part of the house  where there he finds a doctor sleeping  in a room meanwhile the parents talk  about the possibility of their child  dying during the third session of  treatment the mother says that she  believed that the doctor had saved all  her patients and that she cannot believe  that they were lied to about it however  the man responds that she is the guilty  one here and they begin to fight  meanwhile eli finds files in which he  sees that all the children before him  had died after treatment 3. a nurse  almost finds him but the boy runs off  looking for his mother to help him  escape we see that she also wants to  leave and has even put his suitcases in  the car but the doctor convinces her  that she is capable of saving the child  from his illness meanwhile eli tells his  father everything he discovered but he  ignores him and begins to tell him about  beautiful memories of the past the boy  is frightened and his father tells him  he is very sorry for what he will do  after which he injects him with a  sedative at that moment the nurses  arrive and take him away although the  boy yells that they are going to kill  him we see that the sedative doesn't  work and eli escapes and gets mad at  everyone saying that the ghost kids just  want to help him then eli runs to hide  in the doctor's room where there he  discovers that she used to be a nun in  addition he also finds a secret passage  that leads him to a kind of altar for  rituals the doctor locks him up in there  and we see that not even his mother  helps him the child begins to feel the  side effects of his allergies however  soon after eli wakes up and realizes  that his allergies disappear and that he  can breathe normally he yells at his  parents about it asking why did you lie  to 