ill him  but the boy kills him with his powers  then his mother apologizes for having  lied to him for so long he forgives her  and they leave the house together while  the boy sets everything in his path on  fire once outside eli can breathe  normally his friend is waiting for him  and tells him that she already knew he  was a devil's son because she is also a  devil's daughter but that she could not  tell him anything because satan demands  that each one of his children must earn  their place the girl tells him that she  can take him to meet their father she  suggests that the mother should drive  eli's mother is nervous but he like  calms her down by saying make a wish  just like she used to calm him down they  drive away as the house burns down  the end  if you liked the video please leave a  like and subscribe to continue receiving  the recaps of the best bizarre and  sci-fi movies my name is tc and i'll see  you in the next video goodbye

